m 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 that same pair ran 42% of normal on the middle of the grids, after March to April hit 162% in 2025. So far in 2026, June to July came in at 161% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 21140 had its driest year in 1963 at 46%.</p>"}
